ila. Alla disperata ricerca di un successo, Dickens si affida all'ispirazione della vita reale e alla sua vivida immaginazione per dare vita a Ebenezer Scrooge, Tiny Tim e altri personaggi classici in \"A Christmas Carol\", trasformando per sempre le festività natalizie nella celebrazione conosciuta oggi.","tagline":"Come Charles Dickens ha scritto \"Canto di Natale\" e ha creato una tradizione."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In 1843, despite the fact that Dickens is a successful writer, the failure of his latest book puts his career at a crossroads, until the moment when, struggling with inspiration and confronting reality with his childhood memories, a new character is born in the depths of his troubled mind; an old, lonely, embittered man, so vivid, so human, that a whole world grows around him, a story so inspiring that changed the meaning of Christmas forever.","tagline":"How Charles Dickens wrote “A Christmas Carol” and created a tradition."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Ab5MM2XnW33AzfM7Wjhb8dqV6Pv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hm8Gux0946IfeJ1PZwztOo6lVHH.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":450322,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Ab5MM2XnW33AzfM7Wjhb8dqV6Pv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Ab5MM2XnW33AzfM7Wjhb8dqV6Pv.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Ab5MM2XnW33AzfM7Wjhb8dqV6Pv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Ab5MM2XnW33AzfM7Wjhb8dqV6Pv.jpg","language":"it","width":1707,"height":2560},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lHjoSZmq9lCyvTCcMhn2B34GDlw.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lHjoSZmq9lCyvTCcMhn2B34GDlw.jpg","lan